WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 24=

01:46.700 --> 01:49.420
Tomorrow really
is perfect hunting weather.

01:58.740 --> 01:59.980
Please be very careful tomorrow.

02:04.300 --> 02:05.580
Tomorrow isn't even here yet,

02:06.620 --> 02:07.820
and you're already
worrying yourself sick.

02:09.380 --> 02:10.580
Haven't you heard

02:10.980 --> 02:12.260
the saying

02:12.340 --> 02:14.700
that every moment of a night like this
is precious?

02:17.300 --> 02:17.980
Then how about

02:18.900 --> 02:20.060
we save our strength

02:20.740 --> 02:21.460
and get some proper rest?

02:23.220 --> 02:25.020
I am getting proper rest.

02:31.180 --> 02:35.160
♪Playing out life's game,
forever by your side♪

02:35.160 --> 02:39.340
♪Innocent years drift gently by♪

02:39.700 --> 02:46.540
♪I thought time might stand still
forever at that crossroads♪

02:46.540 --> 02:48.500
(Who knows what tomorrow will bring?)

02:50.060 --> 02:51.180
(But whatever happens,)

02:52.220 --> 02:54.100
(I must kill Meng Zaishi.)

02:55.140 --> 02:59.660
(Huai)

03:01.180 --> 03:03.620
(Huai)

03:18.260 --> 03:20.020
As expected of your personal guards,
Your Royal Highness.

03:20.660 --> 03:23.140
Quite the killer instinct.

03:23.940 --> 03:24.820
Lord Yu, you flatter me.

03:25.700 --> 03:26.740
How lucky they are

03:27.260 --> 03:29.020
to earn praise from an expert like you.

03:33.940 --> 03:34.820
(Wanyao, I'm sorry.)

03:35.620 --> 03:36.620
(I'm breaking my promise again.)

03:37.260 --> 03:38.740
(I can't hunt that deer for you.)

03:39.580 --> 03:40.380
(Just like)

03:41.580 --> 03:43.140
(I couldn't take you away
from Sheng'an.)

03:45.420 --> 03:47.140
(Huai)

04:02.940 --> 04:04.140
The deer wears a golden bell.

04:04.340 --> 04:05.940
It was released
into the mountains last night.

04:06.260 --> 04:07.300
The gong signals the start.

04:07.700 --> 04:08.980
Teams, enter the mountains.

04:09.580 --> 04:11.100
The deer hunt ends

04:11.540 --> 04:13.300
at sunrise tomorrow.

04:23.260 --> 04:29.060
(Huai)

04:48.860 --> 04:49.180
Go!

04:52.620 --> 04:52.980
Mr. Wei.

04:53.620 --> 04:53.940
Mr. Wei.

04:54.140 --> 04:54.620
Mr. Yan.

04:56.340 --> 04:57.380
Why are you leading your horse?

04:57.780 --> 04:58.780
Did you cram in some riding practice?

04:59.220 --> 05:00.180
Even so,

05:01.260 --> 05:02.540
I doubt you can beat them.

05:03.140 --> 05:04.100
I'm not here to hunt the deer.

05:04.780 --> 05:06.300
I'm here to see someone.

05:07.140 --> 05:07.620
Who?

05:07.820 --> 05:08.380
Mu Xianqing.

05:09.020 --> 05:09.980
What do you want with him?

05:12.500 --> 05:13.460
I'm going to talk him

05:13.780 --> 05:16.260
into killing Meng Zaishi
in the chaos out in the mountains.

05:20.700 --> 05:22.060
After all, if he misses this chance,

05:22.500 --> 05:23.300
he'll never get a better shot

05:23.300 --> 05:24.580
at taking the Central Circuit.

05:27.780 --> 05:28.180
Mr. Wei,

05:29.140 --> 05:30.100
this is a big deal.

05:30.580 --> 05:31.260
It stays between us.

05:32.100 --> 05:32.980
If I'm back

05:33.300 --> 05:34.020
in two hours,

05:34.500 --> 05:36.020
we'll wait for news
of Meng Zaishi's death.

05:36.860 --> 05:37.540
If I'm not,

05:38.260 --> 05:39.860
that means Mu Xianqing refused me.

05:40.620 --> 05:41.740
And I'm probably done for.

05:46.060 --> 05:46.500
Mr. Yan,

05:47.060 --> 05:47.940
since you told me,

05:48.660 --> 05:49.820
you must've made up your mind.

05:50.980 --> 05:52.140
But I still have to ask.

05:52.860 --> 05:53.740
Is this really

05:54.020 --> 05:54.940
what you have to do?

05:56.740 --> 05:57.540
It's not that I have to.

05:58.340 --> 05:59.300
There's no other way.

06:00.460 --> 06:01.260
As for my chances,

06:02.020 --> 06:03.380
whether in Sheng'an or Lingnan,

06:03.660 --> 06:05.100
I've never met anyone my silver tongue

06:05.580 --> 06:06.700
couldn't win over.

06:08.100 --> 06:08.740
Let's hope

06:09.340 --> 06:10.220
this time's the same.

06:11.260 --> 06:11.620
Mr. Wei.

06:12.500 --> 06:12.900
I'm off.

06:19.460 --> 06:19.740
Go!

06:31.620 --> 06:32.580
Your Highness.

06:34.620 --> 06:36.380
Forgive me for not getting off
to pay my respects.

06:40.660 --> 06:41.180
Doesn't matter.

06:42.060 --> 06:42.900
Sooner or later,

06:43.900 --> 06:45.460
I'll make you look at me
the way you used to,

06:46.180 --> 06:47.900
with tenderness in your eyes,

06:49.060 --> 06:49.900
begging me.

06:52.620 --> 06:53.500
We'll see.

06:58.260 --> 06:58.700
It'll happen soon.

07:27.100 --> 07:27.460
Zhi.

07:40.940 --> 07:41.580
Everyone,

07:42.300 --> 07:43.060
follow this dog

07:43.860 --> 07:44.540
and take it slow.

07:45.060 --> 07:45.860
Don't make a sound.

07:47.100 --> 07:47.500
Zhi.

07:48.940 --> 07:49.260
Track.

07:57.220 --> 07:58.660
(Didn't expect to find him so fast.)

07:59.500 --> 08:00.900
(But what's Mu Xianqing doing here?)

08:02.180 --> 08:03.460
(Looks like he's waiting for someone.)

08:13.860 --> 08:15.700
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

08:15.700 --> 08:16.660
(Why'd the Crown Prince)

08:16.660 --> 08:17.940
(get involved?)

08:20.420 --> 08:21.980
(He's always kept his abilities hidden)

08:22.180 --> 08:24.260
(and never dared show his strength
before Lord Yu.)

08:26.420 --> 08:27.420
(Why step into the spotlight now?)

08:28.260 --> 08:29.620
(What is he really after?)

08:29.620 --> 08:32.860
(Qing-Xun)

08:45.860 --> 08:46.180
Go!

08:50.380 --> 08:50.820
Come clean.

08:51.260 --> 08:51.820
Did you just stumble in,

08:52.580 --> 08:53.580
or were you spying on purpose?

08:54.580 --> 08:56.380
(No wonder the Crown Prince
suddenly made a move.)

08:57.260 --> 08:58.820
(So he's found a new ally.)

08:59.740 --> 09:00.220
Yang Si,

09:01.260 --> 09:02.980
when did the Crown Prince
and Mu Xianqing team up?

09:03.500 --> 09:04.780
Before the Qianqiu Banquet or after?

09:06.980 --> 09:07.500
Yan Shang,

09:07.860 --> 09:08.780
you must have a death wish!

09:09.620 --> 09:10.140
Yang Si,

09:10.940 --> 09:12.420
I know what you're planning next.

09:12.860 --> 09:14.900
But please, talk the Crown Prince

09:15.500 --> 09:16.620
out of doing anything rash.

09:17.180 --> 09:19.380
If those two have been scheming together
all along,

09:20.060 --> 09:21.380
Yu Cheng'an probably already knows,

09:21.500 --> 09:23.300
which is why he let them hunt together.

09:23.860 --> 09:25.940
Even I caught the Crown Prince's move

09:26.260 --> 09:27.460
and found it odd.

09:28.140 --> 09:29.620
Yu Cheng'an can't be unaware.

09:44.380 --> 09:45.220
But it's come to this.

09:45.820 --> 09:46.780
Even if we do nothing,

09:47.500 --> 09:48.900
would Yu Cheng'an
ever let His Royal Highness off?

09:50.460 --> 09:51.700
Why not wait and see,

09:52.020 --> 09:52.980
and play defense?

09:54.020 --> 09:55.340
Better than a misstep.

09:59.100 --> 10:00.380
We've already come this far.

10:01.020 --> 10:02.220
Keep playing along,

10:02.620 --> 10:03.580
and we'll only miss our window,

10:04.340 --> 10:05.740
maybe even let Yu Cheng'an steal
the initiative.

10:05.980 --> 10:07.820
Tonight we fight to the death!

10:07.820 --> 10:09.740
But now's not the time.

10:11.300 --> 10:11.940
Trust me.

10:15.900 --> 10:16.300
Okay.

10:17.940 --> 10:18.420
Yan Shang,

10:19.220 --> 10:20.980
you think
we're throwing rocks at a wall?

10:22.100 --> 10:23.860
You underestimate the Crown Prince.

10:30.340 --> 10:31.020
Yan Shang,

10:31.380 --> 10:32.140
don't blame me.

10:33.340 --> 10:34.500
If those two find out,

10:35.220 --> 10:36.300
you're as good as dead.

10:41.140 --> 10:42.420
It's been more than two hours.

10:42.980 --> 10:43.540
What do I do?

10:48.060 --> 10:49.420
(I need to find Miss Zhao for help.)

10:59.100 --> 10:59.580
Yan Shang?

11:01.620 --> 11:02.100
Yan Shang?

11:03.020 --> 11:03.460
Yan Shang!

11:05.700 --> 11:06.140
Yan Shang?

11:07.500 --> 11:07.940
Yan Shang?

11:08.740 --> 11:09.540
Are you okay?

11:10.460 --> 11:11.020
Yan Shang?

11:14.700 --> 11:15.100
Hurry.

11:15.820 --> 11:16.580
Take me
to the temporary imperial palace.

11:23.420 --> 11:30.380
(Temporary Imperial Palace at
the Hunting Grounds, Yuhua Palace, Yu)

11:31.820 --> 11:33.060
(Yu Cheng'an's always)

11:33.420 --> 11:34.420
(Yu)
(heavily guarded wherever he goes.)

11:35.580 --> 11:36.140
(Yet)

11:37.100 --> 11:38.180
(it's so loose here today.)

11:39.540 --> 11:41.580
(Yuhua Palace, Yu.)

11:41.580 --> 11:42.020
Who are you?

11:45.700 --> 11:46.340
I

11:47.060 --> 11:48.620
am a collator at the Hongwen Hall.

11:49.060 --> 11:50.580
I came to the hunting grounds
with my colleagues.

11:51.260 --> 11:51.980
It's truly a rare chance,

11:52.100 --> 11:53.220
so I came to pay my respects to Lord Yu.

11:53.860 --> 11:54.740
Please pass it on.

11:55.060 --> 11:55.340
Get lost!

11:57.460 --> 11:58.940
I've been to Lord Yu's residence.

11:59.540 --> 11:59.860
Really.

12:01.020 --> 12:01.780
Haven't you seen me before?

12:02.580 --> 12:02.940
What about you?

12:06.740 --> 12:08.180
Please, cut me some slack.

12:15.900 --> 12:16.420
Mr. Liu!

12:17.780 --> 12:18.220
Mr. Liu.

12:20.940 --> 12:23.380
(Huai)

12:26.140 --> 12:26.900
I'm here to see Lord Yu.

12:29.900 --> 12:30.860
Lord Yu's tied up.

12:31.220 --> 12:31.780
No visitors.

12:32.500 --> 12:33.180
Sir, please go back.

12:37.740 --> 12:38.940
Please, just give me a chance.

12:39.140 --> 12:40.300
I just need one meeting with Lord Yu.

12:42.860 --> 12:43.740
Please go back.

12:44.460 --> 12:45.620
Lord Yu really isn't seeing anyone.

12:48.060 --> 12:49.300
Why are you here causing trouble?

12:50.780 --> 12:51.260
Don't worry.

12:51.820 --> 12:53.300
That deer was never released.

12:53.940 --> 12:54.860
It's locked in a cage.

12:55.780 --> 12:56.180
Wenji,

12:56.940 --> 12:57.620
what he's really hunting here

12:58.140 --> 12:59.300
is the Crown Prince.

13:03.340 --> 13:03.660
Shang.

13:04.820 --> 13:06.180
This is none of our business.

13:06.460 --> 13:07.620
Stop asking me.

13:08.340 --> 13:09.300
You'll get me killed.

13:15.700 --> 13:16.300
Get out!

13:16.700 --> 13:18.340
A nobody official like you

13:18.660 --> 13:19.500
wants to see Lord Yu?

13:19.900 --> 13:20.220
Out!

13:27.860 --> 13:29.700
(Yu, Yuhua Palace)

13:38.340 --> 13:38.820
(Wanyao,)

13:40.340 --> 13:41.340
(where are you?)

13:43.900 --> 13:44.740
(The hunting grounds)

13:45.620 --> 13:47.300
(are the most dangerous place
right now.)

13:49.940 --> 13:50.900
(Every moment you stay)

13:52.940 --> 13:54.140
(puts you in greater danger.)

14:12.100 --> 14:12.500
Your Highness.

14:13.020 --> 14:14.100
When do we start looking for the deer?

14:16.300 --> 14:16.980
The real hunt

14:18.100 --> 14:19.820
begins after sunset.

14:32.140 --> 14:32.500
Your Highness.

14:32.940 --> 14:34.020
Zhi stopped up ahead.

14:34.620 --> 14:35.180
Meng Zaishi

14:35.620 --> 14:36.420
should be around here.

14:37.500 --> 14:37.900
Good.

15:09.620 --> 15:10.300
(It's the golden bell.)

15:11.380 --> 15:12.100
(The deer is nearby.)

15:13.860 --> 15:14.940
(Please,)

15:15.460 --> 15:16.580
(let Wanyao get there first.)

15:43.540 --> 15:44.340
The golden bell?

15:46.300 --> 15:47.300
Just a hundred paces away.

15:47.980 --> 15:49.060
Heaven's on my side.

15:50.980 --> 15:51.780
You stay here.

15:52.460 --> 15:54.420
Don't do anything to spook the prey.

15:54.660 --> 15:54.980
Yes.

15:54.980 --> 15:55.220
Yes.

16:09.220 --> 16:09.940
(The golden bell?)

16:10.860 --> 16:11.700
(But there's no deer at all.)

16:12.980 --> 16:13.660
(It's Wanyao.)

16:14.500 --> 16:15.500
(She's luring Meng Zaishi in.)

17:05.500 --> 17:06.660
Your Highness,

17:07.540 --> 17:08.700
it seems you heard the bell too.

17:11.820 --> 17:12.540
So

17:13.140 --> 17:14.260
who do you think wins tonight,

17:15.180 --> 17:16.460
you or me?

17:21.700 --> 17:22.300
General Meng.

17:23.260 --> 17:23.980
Is this

17:24.860 --> 17:25.700
what you meant?

18:05.700 --> 18:06.340
Stop shooting!

18:06.540 --> 18:07.540
Since you show no mercy,

18:08.340 --> 18:09.460
don't blame me for being ruthless.

18:21.180 --> 18:22.620
Mu Wanyao.

18:23.860 --> 18:25.820
All those bells and ambushes...

18:26.940 --> 18:27.940
After all that trouble,

18:28.780 --> 18:30.220
you still end up right where I want you.

18:33.140 --> 18:34.980
There's a saying from the Central Plains
I really like.

18:35.980 --> 18:37.500
"Raw power beats skill."

18:38.100 --> 18:38.940
Save your schemes

18:39.780 --> 18:41.780
for someone else.

19:19.740 --> 19:20.820
So that's how it is.

19:21.700 --> 19:23.980
You left me an escape route, set a trap,

19:24.980 --> 19:26.180
and waited for me to walk right in.

19:28.020 --> 19:28.780
Mu Wanyao.

19:30.700 --> 19:31.940
I couldn't outsmart you in the end.

19:34.420 --> 19:35.180
I don't care

19:35.620 --> 19:36.300
who kills the deer.

19:37.020 --> 19:38.380
As long as you die by my hand.

19:38.700 --> 19:40.340
Why can't you play fair with me?

19:41.540 --> 19:43.500
I always wanted you alive.

19:44.260 --> 19:45.980
But you've wanted me dead all along.

19:47.220 --> 19:48.500
You're so cruel to me.

19:50.940 --> 19:52.460
I saved your life

19:52.460 --> 19:53.380
in front of Meng Baiyu.

19:54.380 --> 19:55.380
I killed Meng Baiyu,

19:56.020 --> 19:57.700
but it was you who reaped the spoils.

19:58.540 --> 19:59.260
Fair?

20:00.020 --> 20:01.140
We've been even for a long time.

20:01.500 --> 20:02.860
Then why do you hate me so much?

20:03.340 --> 20:04.460
You brought this on yourself.

20:05.700 --> 20:07.020
If you'd stayed put in North Jing,

20:07.300 --> 20:08.260
we could've coexisted just fine.

20:09.140 --> 20:11.060
But you had to travel all the way
to Sheng'an

20:11.260 --> 20:12.180
to cut off my future.

20:13.020 --> 20:14.540
Then don't blame me
for sending you to your death.

20:14.780 --> 20:15.940
After all that,

20:16.900 --> 20:17.980
you're still blaming me for coming
to Sheng'an

20:18.500 --> 20:19.940
and ruining your little romance.

20:20.580 --> 20:22.540
You exposed my secrets
at the Qianqiu Banquet.

20:23.300 --> 20:25.340
Weren't you trying to get me killed
by public opinion?

20:27.260 --> 20:28.660
Knowing how you usually operate,

20:28.660 --> 20:30.420
I doubt you'd care
about something like that.

20:34.580 --> 20:35.420
If you ask me,

20:36.740 --> 20:37.940
you're just worried

20:37.940 --> 20:39.420
about your lover.

20:42.860 --> 20:44.580
If he minds
that you can't bear children...

20:45.380 --> 20:46.260
I don't mind.

20:46.500 --> 20:46.900
Shut it!

20:51.420 --> 20:52.420
Everything I've done

20:53.260 --> 20:54.620
since coming to Sheng'an

20:55.180 --> 20:56.940
has been out of love for you.

20:58.620 --> 20:59.340
In North Jing,

21:00.180 --> 21:02.140
when a man likes a girl,
he just throws her on his horse.

21:02.980 --> 21:04.300
That's just how it is.

21:04.980 --> 21:06.260
Even if she resists at first,

21:07.380 --> 21:09.180
she'll come around after a few days.

21:09.660 --> 21:10.820
You treated me like prey

21:11.260 --> 21:12.940
you could just throw on a horse.

21:13.260 --> 21:14.580
Then taste what it's like

21:15.260 --> 21:16.500
to be prey at someone else's mercy.

21:17.420 --> 21:18.020
Meng Zaishi,

21:18.580 --> 21:19.380
since that's what you think,

21:20.740 --> 21:21.740
then you deserve to die.

21:28.340 --> 21:28.940
No, Your Highness!

21:35.820 --> 21:36.380
Yan Shang?

21:37.260 --> 21:37.940
What are you doing?

21:39.060 --> 21:39.740
Thank god.

21:41.100 --> 21:41.500
Your Highness,

21:41.900 --> 21:43.180
now's not the time to kill.

21:43.540 --> 21:43.900
Go.

21:44.260 --> 21:45.220
Leave the hunting grounds now.

21:46.380 --> 21:47.060
What happened?

21:47.260 --> 21:48.740
Mu Xianqing
and the Eastern Circuit behind him

21:49.220 --> 21:50.020
have joined the Crown Prince.

21:50.260 --> 21:51.460
I saw them plotting.

21:51.940 --> 21:53.580
The fight for the throne
happens tonight, right here

21:54.180 --> 21:54.980
in the hunting grounds.

21:55.700 --> 21:57.180
No wonder
the Crown Prince's been wary of me.

21:58.260 --> 21:59.340
So he went to Mu Xianqing.

22:05.020 --> 22:06.500
They're trying to take down Yu tonight?

22:09.900 --> 22:11.420
No wonder Xun,
who's always so self-important,

22:12.460 --> 22:14.900
got involved in this hunting mess.

22:15.340 --> 22:15.860
Exactly.

22:16.260 --> 22:17.420
They think Yu Cheng'an's forces

22:17.420 --> 22:18.460
are thin in the hunting grounds,

22:18.700 --> 22:19.940
and it's worth the gamble.

22:28.900 --> 22:29.780
After tonight,

22:30.700 --> 22:32.060
Huai changes hands.

22:35.300 --> 22:36.980
Congratulations, Your Royal Highness.

22:37.500 --> 22:38.300
It's a bit early

22:38.940 --> 22:40.180
to say that.

22:40.940 --> 22:42.780
We wait for the moon to reach its peak.

22:43.820 --> 22:44.660
Once the Zi hour passes,

22:46.340 --> 22:47.020
Yang Si and I

22:47.860 --> 22:48.940
will strike
the temporary imperial palace

22:49.380 --> 22:50.180
as planned.

22:51.700 --> 22:52.700
If Yu Cheng'an catches on,

22:53.540 --> 22:54.820
he'll move to encircle the palace.

22:55.660 --> 22:56.060
That's when

22:56.620 --> 22:57.780
we'll need you to hold the rear,
General Mu.

23:00.500 --> 23:01.540
Your Royal Highness, don't worry.

23:02.260 --> 23:04.700
Taking down that eunuch
will be like shooting fish in a barrel.

23:06.060 --> 23:07.740
He won't get any reinforcements.

23:08.060 --> 23:10.860
I've long heard of your valor in battle.

23:11.580 --> 23:12.620
With you on my side,

23:13.420 --> 23:14.980
my strength is doubled.

23:15.460 --> 23:16.900
But killing him

23:17.580 --> 23:18.700
won't be so easy.

23:19.540 --> 23:21.380
I hear he has a man named Qiu Shuo.

23:23.220 --> 23:24.180
A real handful.

23:26.980 --> 23:27.820
Your Royal Highness,

23:28.620 --> 23:30.340
I'll risk my life with you.

23:30.900 --> 23:32.100
When it's done,

23:33.220 --> 23:35.100
surely you won't forget
the Eastern Circuit's contribution?

23:35.860 --> 23:36.420
Today,

23:37.260 --> 23:39.020
we've entrusted each other
with our lives.

23:40.220 --> 23:41.380
Once the Yu faction is wiped out,

23:42.060 --> 23:43.340
I'll give you

23:44.260 --> 23:44.780
whatever

23:45.420 --> 23:46.620
you want.

23:58.020 --> 23:59.060
By then,

24:00.300 --> 24:01.820
North Jing will finally be united.

24:02.620 --> 24:03.220
I'd

24:04.100 --> 24:05.140
be glad to see that.

24:11.740 --> 24:12.980
The Crown Prince took this risky step

24:13.380 --> 24:14.420
without even telling me.

24:15.660 --> 24:16.500
But it's come to this.

24:17.420 --> 24:19.060
I can only burn my boats and join him.

24:19.780 --> 24:20.460
Don't.

24:21.020 --> 24:22.060
Yu Cheng'an's been ready all along.

24:22.540 --> 24:24.100
He's been waiting for the prey
to walk into his trap.

24:25.820 --> 24:26.660
Absolutely true.

24:32.500 --> 24:33.060
Third-Place Scholar.

24:34.220 --> 24:37.460
Were you saying all that
just so I would hear it?

24:40.220 --> 24:41.420
You're dead tonight no matter what.

24:42.180 --> 24:42.900
Listen all you want.

24:43.940 --> 24:44.860
Wait, wait.

24:46.780 --> 24:48.260
Since it was meant for me,

24:49.980 --> 24:51.500
how about you hear me out first.

24:52.700 --> 24:54.300
Mu Xianqing allying
with the Crown Prince?

24:55.700 --> 24:57.020
I doubt that's for real.

24:58.660 --> 24:59.900
Tell us everything you know.

25:00.980 --> 25:02.500
The Central and the Eastern Circuits
have never gotten along.

25:03.380 --> 25:05.780
The Mengs and Mu Xianqing have been
at each other's throats for decades.

25:07.020 --> 25:08.060
We probably know

25:09.180 --> 25:10.460
Mu Xianqing's character better than you

25:11.380 --> 25:12.500
and the Crown Prince do.

25:13.260 --> 25:14.420
Remember Yuan Jia,
the Military Commander

25:15.060 --> 25:15.980
of the Western Circuit?

25:31.260 --> 25:31.660
Your Highness.

25:34.700 --> 25:36.780
He and Mu Xianqing have been allies
for decades.

25:37.260 --> 25:38.700
Always followed Mu Xianqing's lead.

25:39.700 --> 25:40.860
But you probably don't know

25:41.060 --> 25:42.620
how many times
Mu Xianqing has screwed him over.

25:43.780 --> 25:45.980
It's only because they share
a common enemy,

25:46.060 --> 25:47.140
the Central Circuit,

25:47.860 --> 25:49.460
that Yuan Jia had to swallow his pride.

25:50.620 --> 25:52.220
Mu Xianqing may look valorous,

25:52.540 --> 25:53.380
but he's vicious.

25:53.900 --> 25:54.900
And he's insanely greedy.

25:55.900 --> 25:57.540
He has no sense of honor.

25:58.740 --> 25:59.820
So I guarantee you,

26:01.140 --> 26:03.060
tonight with the Crown Prince,

26:03.740 --> 26:05.460
he'll turn on him at the last minute.

26:09.060 --> 26:11.740
Then the Crown Prince
will be fighting on two fronts tonight.

26:12.580 --> 26:13.820
If he storms
the temporary imperial palace

26:14.220 --> 26:15.900
and Mu Xianqing doesn't back him up,

26:16.460 --> 26:17.820
with the few men the Crown Prince has,

26:19.780 --> 26:21.420
he's as good as dead.

26:21.980 --> 26:23.540
Best case, he ends up a prisoner.

26:24.620 --> 26:25.660
Worst case, Yu Cheng'an

26:26.220 --> 26:26.820
finishes him off

26:27.660 --> 26:28.340
for good.

26:29.340 --> 26:30.380
Even if the Crown Prince pulls it off,

26:31.300 --> 26:33.860
after barely surviving Yu Cheng'an,

26:34.380 --> 26:35.420
his men will be exhausted.

26:35.740 --> 26:37.300
And he'll still have Mu Xianqing
breathing down his neck.

26:38.620 --> 26:39.060
Your Highness,

26:39.900 --> 26:41.540
Yu Cheng'an has allowed the Crown Prince

26:41.940 --> 26:43.060
and Mu Xianqing to join the hunt.

26:43.780 --> 26:44.740
He must have something planned.

26:45.860 --> 26:46.420
So

26:47.100 --> 26:49.100
Yu Cheng'an has already chosen
a new heir to the throne.

26:49.860 --> 26:51.660
By then,
with a new emperor under his thumb,

26:53.340 --> 26:54.500
my father will be expendable too.

26:54.860 --> 26:55.220
Right.

26:56.500 --> 26:57.060
Tonight,

26:57.540 --> 27:00.100
the Crown Prince and Yu Cheng'an are
still locked in battle with no winner.

27:00.540 --> 27:01.980
We need to get back
and save your father.

27:02.580 --> 27:03.100
We have to hurry.

27:03.900 --> 27:04.340
Let's go!

27:06.300 --> 27:06.740
Your Highness.

27:07.620 --> 27:08.660
I can't ride half as well as you.

27:08.820 --> 27:09.580
I can't keep up.

27:10.140 --> 27:11.540
There's no time to lose.

27:11.900 --> 27:12.900
Take Fang Tong and the others
and go ahead.

27:13.340 --> 27:14.620
I'll meet up with Wei Shu and the Zhaos,

27:14.740 --> 27:15.740
then join you at the palace.

27:18.180 --> 27:18.940
Be careful.

27:21.820 --> 27:22.620
Keep an eye on Meng Zaishi.

27:25.620 --> 27:26.100
Don't worry.

27:32.140 --> 27:33.900
Fang Tong, have two men
protect Yan Shang.

27:34.460 --> 27:35.260
Everyone else, follow me!

27:42.220 --> 27:42.740
Third-Place Scholar,

27:44.540 --> 27:45.340
right now,

27:46.100 --> 27:47.740
the most dangerous place
is the hunting grounds.

27:49.700 --> 27:50.900
You tricked her into going back, right?

27:53.220 --> 27:53.820
Yeah.

27:55.580 --> 27:58.780
Charge!

28:31.820 --> 28:34.260
Her Highness put your life in my hands.

28:36.500 --> 28:38.140
You seem pretty sure I won't kill you.

28:38.700 --> 28:40.500
She gave you the job of dealing with me,

28:42.020 --> 28:43.220
which proves you're a smart man.

28:44.020 --> 28:45.420
That's how things stand tonight.

28:46.220 --> 28:47.260
A smart man

28:48.100 --> 28:49.820
should know I can't be killed right now.

28:50.780 --> 28:51.860
Because I am

28:51.860 --> 28:53.300
the only wild card

28:54.020 --> 28:55.020
not in either side's plan.

28:56.180 --> 28:56.580
Yes.

28:57.700 --> 28:58.220
Long term,

28:58.820 --> 29:00.060
you command
the Central Circuit's troops.

29:00.860 --> 29:01.340
Short term,

29:02.300 --> 29:03.300
in these hunting grounds,

29:03.460 --> 29:05.420
apart from the Crown Prince
and Mu Xianqing,

29:06.180 --> 29:07.660
you brought the most men.

29:09.980 --> 29:10.700
You can't die.

29:13.300 --> 29:14.460
But have you thought about it?

29:16.340 --> 29:18.140
Whether it's Mu Xianqing or Yu Cheng'an,

29:18.780 --> 29:19.780
once they take down the Crown Prince,

29:19.780 --> 29:21.940
their next move is straight
for the palace.

29:22.620 --> 29:24.140
You tricked her into going back.

29:25.180 --> 29:27.580
Aren't you just letting her wait to die
with her old man?

29:28.860 --> 29:29.460
Then don't let them

29:30.260 --> 29:32.220
get to the next step, General Meng.

29:32.980 --> 29:34.780
Only then can Her Highness
truly be saved.

29:37.860 --> 29:38.340
Third-Place Scholar.

29:41.700 --> 29:43.060
Your name's Yan Shang, right?

29:44.500 --> 29:45.260
No time to waste.

29:45.900 --> 29:46.500
Come on up.

29:47.540 --> 29:48.860
First, tell me your terms.

29:51.100 --> 29:52.180
Whatever the terms,

29:52.900 --> 29:54.100
you'll help anyway.

30:21.940 --> 30:25.820
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

30:33.900 --> 30:38.180
(Wu, Wei, Shen, You, Xu, Hai)

30:45.980 --> 30:46.500
Mr. Chen.

30:47.180 --> 30:47.820
It's the Zi hour.

30:48.980 --> 30:49.700
Close the gate.

30:54.140 --> 30:54.740
Princess Danyang?

30:55.180 --> 30:56.300
Aren't you at the hunting grounds?

30:56.460 --> 30:57.460
Why are you back?

31:04.380 --> 31:04.980
Mr. Chen.

31:07.140 --> 31:08.060
I have urgent business

31:08.420 --> 31:09.260
with my father.

31:09.860 --> 31:10.660
Please let him know.

31:11.740 --> 31:12.940
His Majesty has already gone to bed.

31:13.180 --> 31:14.380
Come back tomorrow morning.

31:15.300 --> 31:16.780
Just tell my father
Princess Danyang is here.

31:17.380 --> 31:18.580
He won't blame me.

31:19.820 --> 31:21.060
His Majesty gave orders before bed

31:21.380 --> 31:22.860
that no one is to disturb him.

31:23.140 --> 31:24.500
I wouldn't dare disobey.

31:25.940 --> 31:26.940
I have good news.

31:28.220 --> 31:29.340
If I wait until tomorrow,

31:29.820 --> 31:31.100
I'm afraid my father will blame me

31:31.180 --> 31:32.260
for not telling him first.

31:36.420 --> 31:38.340
Then why not tell me?

31:38.620 --> 31:39.820
I'll pass it on for you?

31:40.940 --> 31:41.620
That won't do.

31:42.980 --> 31:43.900
I must tell my father

31:44.460 --> 31:45.820
this good news myself

31:46.100 --> 31:46.860
and make him happy.

31:48.940 --> 31:49.220
Well...

31:49.780 --> 31:50.140
Father!

31:50.140 --> 31:50.820
Your Highness.

31:50.820 --> 31:51.180
Father!

31:51.220 --> 31:51.900
Your Highness!

31:52.620 --> 31:53.860
Your Highness, there's nothing I can do.

31:54.180 --> 31:55.420
His Majesty has already gone to bed.

31:55.740 --> 31:57.060
Come back tomorrow morning.

31:59.260 --> 31:59.620
Never mind.

32:00.300 --> 32:01.260
Since he's asleep,

32:01.700 --> 32:02.580
I'll come back tomorrow.

32:09.500 --> 32:10.980
We'll be waiting to welcome you,
Your Highness!

32:17.260 --> 32:19.100
(Father never sleeps that soundly.)

32:19.380 --> 32:20.420
(Not a single cough.)

32:22.020 --> 32:22.980
(That's not him)

32:23.460 --> 32:24.620
(in that bed.)

32:26.340 --> 32:27.940
I do like Mu Wanyao.

32:29.380 --> 32:31.380
But I'm not about to go die for her.

32:32.180 --> 32:34.100
We both know
the Crown Prince is doomed tonight.

32:34.300 --> 32:35.020
It's already decided.

32:35.940 --> 32:38.100
You come dragging me in
when your backs were against the wall.

32:38.980 --> 32:40.140
Don't you think it's a bit late?

32:41.660 --> 32:42.700
I came to Sheng'an

32:43.060 --> 32:44.140
just to deliver a birthday gift

32:45.100 --> 32:45.660
and

32:46.340 --> 32:48.420
take back the woman the Emperor owes me.

32:49.700 --> 32:50.820
Now the waters are this muddy.

32:51.660 --> 32:52.460
None of my concern.

32:53.140 --> 32:54.220
I'd be more than happy to see

32:54.420 --> 32:55.380
all three sides lose.

32:58.220 --> 32:59.460
General Meng, have you ever heard

33:00.140 --> 33:01.620
that the game opens up where you cut?

33:02.740 --> 33:04.660
The Crown Prince,
Yu Cheng'an, and Mu Xianqing

33:04.980 --> 33:06.220
all have their own agendas.

33:06.940 --> 33:08.420
If no one else enters the game,

33:09.020 --> 33:10.860
one of the three will come out on top.

33:12.540 --> 33:13.180
What if

33:13.940 --> 33:15.500
Mu Xianqing wins?

33:18.980 --> 33:19.540
Military Governor,

33:20.300 --> 33:21.460
are we still holding position?

33:22.500 --> 33:22.860
No rush.

33:23.620 --> 33:24.300
Wait a little longer.

33:26.220 --> 33:27.420
Let the two fight.

33:27.540 --> 33:29.540
I want to see which one kills the other.

33:31.020 --> 33:32.700
Wait till one's dead and one's crippled,

33:33.940 --> 33:34.900
then we step in

33:35.380 --> 33:36.260
and take on whoever's left.

33:37.220 --> 33:37.820
That'll be much easier.

33:38.500 --> 33:39.020
You're right.

33:40.940 --> 33:42.500
Does the Crown Prince

33:43.060 --> 33:44.100
forget

33:45.860 --> 33:47.380
I'm a Mu too?

33:49.100 --> 33:50.860
Once he and the old man are both dead,

33:52.060 --> 33:54.820
I'll be the only one
with a legitimate claim

33:58.260 --> 33:59.180
to the throne.

34:02.860 --> 34:03.980
If you just stand by

34:04.620 --> 34:06.060
and let him reap the spoils,

34:06.660 --> 34:07.860
once he's got all the power,

34:08.540 --> 34:10.780
who's going to be his next target?

34:12.700 --> 34:14.340
Mu Xianqing won't let anyone
pose a threat

34:15.220 --> 34:16.700
to his Eastern Circuit.

34:21.260 --> 34:22.460
But you saw it yourself.

34:24.100 --> 34:26.180
A moment ago, Mu Wanyao wanted me dead.

34:27.420 --> 34:29.260
Now you want an alliance
with a few smooth words.

34:30.300 --> 34:30.980
Why should I trust you?

34:33.100 --> 34:33.740
Let me be blunt.

34:35.020 --> 34:36.740
I'm afraid you'll kill me
once I'm no longer useful.

34:39.100 --> 34:39.660
General Meng,

34:40.940 --> 34:42.340
can your grudge with the Princess

34:43.060 --> 34:45.420
really outweigh the crisis right now?

34:46.700 --> 34:47.460
After tonight,

34:47.780 --> 34:50.060
you'll be the hero who saved Huai

34:50.820 --> 34:52.860
and the man who saved
the Princess's father and brothers.

34:53.900 --> 34:55.180
The Princess is true to her feelings.

34:56.020 --> 34:58.260
She'll treat you differently.

35:04.380 --> 35:05.100
I'm afraid

35:05.980 --> 35:07.620
the Crown Prince has already made
his move.

35:08.700 --> 35:09.220
Guess

35:09.900 --> 35:12.020
whether the Crown Prince promised
Mu Xianqing

35:12.660 --> 35:14.620
your Central Circuit
as part of his reward.

35:27.900 --> 35:28.540
General Meng,

35:29.660 --> 35:31.260
whether we break this deadlock tonight

35:32.820 --> 35:34.100
hangs on your choice.

35:58.300 --> 35:59.340
Why haven't the Eastern Circuit men
shown up?

35:59.900 --> 36:01.060
Yu Cheng'an's main force isn't here.

36:01.460 --> 36:03.060
They must be tied up
with Mu Xianqing outside.

36:03.540 --> 36:04.460
We have to end this fast.

36:04.780 --> 36:06.460
We can't let him call in reinforcements.

36:07.100 --> 36:07.900
Then let's charge in

36:08.220 --> 36:09.140
and grab that traitor Yu!

36:14.860 --> 36:15.980
Who dares intrude?

36:16.380 --> 36:17.060
Yu Cheng'an.

36:18.100 --> 36:19.140
You are a eunuch,

36:19.620 --> 36:21.700
yet you abuse your power
and line your pockets.

36:22.540 --> 36:23.180
Do you plead guilty?

36:27.620 --> 36:28.300
So

36:28.780 --> 36:29.980
it's you, Your Royal Highness.

36:30.860 --> 36:31.860
Don't waste time stalling!

36:32.780 --> 36:33.580
Get out here!

36:34.860 --> 36:35.620
His Royal Highness is merciful.

36:36.100 --> 36:36.900
He'll grant you a clean death!

36:37.580 --> 36:38.100
I'd urge

36:38.660 --> 36:40.700
Your Royal Highness to turn back

36:41.260 --> 36:42.180
before it's too late.

36:43.780 --> 36:46.260
Don't make a fatal mistake.

36:47.180 --> 36:48.060
All troops, hear my command!

36:49.260 --> 36:50.660
Surround this chamber at once.

36:51.220 --> 36:51.940
Anyone who steps out

36:52.220 --> 36:52.660
dies!

37:09.580 --> 37:10.140
(Yu Cheng'an.)

37:10.780 --> 37:11.500
(What are you doing?)

37:35.100 --> 37:35.860
Father?

37:41.780 --> 37:42.700
Why is His Majesty here?

37:44.860 --> 37:45.460
Your Majesty, forgive us!

37:45.780 --> 37:46.540
We meant no offense!

37:53.260 --> 37:54.020
We walked into a trap.

37:54.700 --> 37:55.900
We can't risk making a move.

37:56.660 --> 37:57.580
A head-on fight won't work.

37:58.060 --> 37:58.380
Let's go.

38:27.860 --> 38:28.660
A subject

38:29.660 --> 38:30.380
killing his lord!

38:31.660 --> 38:32.540
A son

38:33.340 --> 38:34.220
killing his father!

38:35.540 --> 38:37.660
Such utter disregard for all order

38:38.540 --> 38:39.860
can't be forgiven!

38:40.580 --> 38:41.700
Your Royal Highness,

38:43.180 --> 38:45.260
do you plead guilty?

38:57.420 --> 38:58.860
Charge!

38:58.860 --> 39:02.340
Kill! Kill them!

39:02.340 --> 39:03.900
Kill!

39:14.860 --> 39:15.860
Why isn't Mu Xianqing here yet?

39:17.660 --> 39:18.380
He's not coming.

39:28.780 --> 39:29.580
Your Majesty.

39:31.460 --> 39:33.300
The Crown Prince pulled
a stunt like this.

39:33.580 --> 39:35.020
How do you explain it?

39:36.700 --> 39:38.500
How do you want to explain it?

39:42.380 --> 39:43.380
The Crown Prince

39:44.380 --> 39:45.540
led troops into the palace.

39:46.620 --> 39:49.100
He's clearly trying to force you
off the throne.

39:49.940 --> 39:52.980
Now all the court officials are
in the hunting grounds.

39:53.460 --> 39:54.340
We should

39:54.540 --> 39:56.500
have them all come and witness it.

39:58.260 --> 40:00.540
Now only one last thing remains.

40:01.540 --> 40:02.740
Your Majesty,

40:03.380 --> 40:05.820
please draft the decree
deposing the heir.

40:54.740 --> 40:55.300
Fight our way out!

40:55.500 --> 40:57.540
Charge!

41:01.740 --> 41:02.340
Cheng'an.

41:04.380 --> 41:07.020
Can you hear me out?

41:07.500 --> 41:07.860
Alright.

41:08.900 --> 41:10.460
I'm all ears.

41:12.300 --> 41:13.100
A puppet

41:13.540 --> 41:15.460
and the hand that pulls the strings

41:16.620 --> 41:18.780
need years to fall into step.

41:20.380 --> 41:21.820
Swap them rashly,

41:23.940 --> 41:25.300
and who knows
what trouble it might bring?

41:33.780 --> 41:34.620
The Crown Prince,

41:35.380 --> 41:35.740
Xun,

41:38.180 --> 41:39.580
born the eldest legitimate son,

41:41.260 --> 41:42.540
second only to the Emperor,

41:44.820 --> 41:46.300
yet walks the path of depravity,

41:46.820 --> 41:48.420
with no word of virtue to his name.

41:59.420 --> 42:00.100
You

42:01.260 --> 42:03.900
really mean to take this all the way?

42:06.900 --> 42:07.340
Your Majesty.

42:08.460 --> 42:10.380
It's fine if you won't write it.

42:12.220 --> 42:12.700
Zidu!

42:29.620 --> 42:32.820
I'd long assumed you were unwell.

42:35.700 --> 42:38.300
You shouldn't overtax your mind.

42:39.020 --> 42:39.340
So

42:40.140 --> 42:40.940
I

42:41.780 --> 42:42.500
had Mr. Wei

42:43.820 --> 42:44.740
draft one.

42:48.100 --> 42:49.140
What do you think, Your Majesty?

42:49.140 --> 42:51.420
(Crown Prince, Xun, born the eldest son,
second only to the Emperor,)

42:54.380 --> 42:56.420
(yet walks the path of depravity,
with no word of virtue to his name.)

43:09.580 --> 43:09.980
By

43:10.740 --> 43:11.900
His Majesty's decree,

43:13.420 --> 43:15.420
seize the rebel Mu Xun.

43:16.260 --> 43:17.820
Dead or alive!

43:48.580 --> 43:49.340
Your Royal Highness, go!

43:50.180 --> 43:50.820
Let's go together!

44:12.820 --> 44:13.180
Go!

44:28.300 --> 44:29.180
How are you hurt this badly?

44:30.220 --> 44:30.580
No.

44:31.100 --> 44:31.940
You won't get far like this.

44:33.540 --> 44:34.260
We need to find somewhere

44:34.540 --> 44:35.380
to stop the bleeding.

44:39.820 --> 44:40.420
Military Governor,

44:40.980 --> 44:42.300
the Crown Prince's personal guards
are all wiped out.

44:42.980 --> 44:45.020
Yu Cheng'an's men
fought the Crown Prince's guards.

44:45.540 --> 44:46.380
Three in ten were casualties

44:46.620 --> 44:47.700
He's not still foolish enough

44:48.340 --> 44:49.660
to wait for us to save him, is he?

44:50.140 --> 44:50.780
He'll be waiting in vain.

44:51.740 --> 44:53.060
Yu Cheng'an has no idea

44:54.820 --> 44:56.500
there's someone waiting to strike

44:57.540 --> 44:59.380
while he's busy watching his own prey.

45:04.980 --> 45:05.420
Move out.

45:06.020 --> 45:06.540
Surround the temporary imperial palace.

45:06.900 --> 45:07.220
Yes!

45:08.580 --> 45:09.860
You actually let him get away?

45:13.180 --> 45:13.700
Pass my order.

45:14.500 --> 45:15.820
Have Qiu Shuo lead the pursuit.

45:16.420 --> 45:16.940
Once found,

45:17.300 --> 45:18.020
kill on sight!

45:18.580 --> 45:18.900
Yes!

45:24.100 --> 45:24.860
Sir, calm down.

45:25.420 --> 45:26.940
Whether the Crown Prince lives or dies,

45:27.260 --> 45:28.060
after tonight,

45:28.420 --> 45:30.020
he's no longer the heir.

45:30.820 --> 45:31.780
A new heir

45:32.180 --> 45:33.580
is about to be named.

45:35.500 --> 45:36.380
It's going to be a long night.

45:37.180 --> 45:38.420
Let's hope dawn

45:38.820 --> 45:39.700
brings

45:40.340 --> 45:41.260
everything we wish for.

45:42.900 --> 45:43.220
Oh, right,

45:43.740 --> 45:44.900
bring that woman in.

45:45.540 --> 45:45.860
Yes.

46:15.540 --> 46:20.300
(Next Episode Preview)

46:24.620 --> 46:25.420
Someone!

46:32.860 --> 46:33.340
Father.

46:37.161 --> 46:40.454
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

46:43.139 --> 46:48.055
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:50.249 --> 46:56.094
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:56.594 --> 47:01.820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

47:04.589 --> 47:09.380
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

47:10.216 --> 47:16.295
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

47:18.096 --> 47:21.246
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

47:21.246 --> 47:22.894
♪Burning bright as a song♪

47:22.946 --> 47:26.670
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

47:27.048 --> 47:31.714
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

47:32.333 --> 47:36.374
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

47:36.865 --> 47:38.980
♪Not a single hour less♪

47:39.020 --> 47:45.966
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:46.729 --> 47:50.182
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:50.362 --> 47:53.507
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:53.946 --> 48:00.583
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

48:00.980 --> 48:03.018
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

48:03.018 --> 48:05.494
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:05.532 --> 48:08.001
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:08.205 --> 48:15.092
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

48:15.404 --> 48:18.675
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

48:18.980 --> 48:22.153
♪My last untouched innocence♪

48:22.477 --> 48:25.903
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

48:26.136 --> 48:29.361
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

48:29.692 --> 48:36.488
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

48:36.857 --> 48:38.919
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

48:38.920 --> 48:41.423
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

48:41.470 --> 48:43.808
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:44.039 --> 48:50.874
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:51.223 --> 48:52.841
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:52.971 --> 48:54.767
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:55.124 --> 48:58.141
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:58.181 --> 48:59.508
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
